      <MissionDesc>GUIDED BY THE BELIEF THAT EVERY PERSON WITH DIABETES HAS THE RIGHT TO LIVE A HEALTHY, HAPPY, AND PRODUCTIVE LIFE, TAKING CONTROL OF YOUR DIABETES EDUCATES AND MOTIVATES PEOPLE WITH DIABETES TO TAKE A MORE ACTIVE ROLE IN THEIR CONDITION AND PROVIDES INNOVATIVE AND INTEGRATIVE CONTINUING EDUCATION TO MEDICAL PROFESSIONALS CARING FOR PEOPLE WITH DIABETES.TCOYD'S VISION IS FOR ALL PEOPLE WITH DIABETES AND THEIR LOVED ONES TO HAVE FULL ACCESS TO PROPER EDUCATION AND THERAPY TO AID IN THE PREVENTION, EARLY DETECTION AND AGGRESSIVE MANAGEMENT OF DIABETES AND ITS COMPLICATIONS.</MissionDesc>
      <SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>0</SignificantNewProgramSrvcInd>
      <SignificantChangeInd>0</SignificantChangeInd>
      <ExpenseAmt>2280311</ExpenseAmt>
      <Desc>THE TCOYD COMMUNITY IS MADE UP OF A DIVERSE GROUP OF ACTIVELY ENGAGED PEOPLE LIVING WITH DIABETES, THEIR LOVED ONES, AND MEDICAL PROFESSIONALS FROM ALL 50 STATES AND OVER 200 COUNTRIES.IN 2024, TCOYD HAD NEARLY 100,000 MONTHLY WEBSITE VISITORS, OVER 14 MILLION IMPRESSIONS ON SOCIAL MEDIA AND OVER 5.7 MILLION VIDEO VIEWS.ALL OF TCOYD'S VIRTUAL PROGRAMS WERE OFFERED FREE OF CHARGE. BY PROVIDING FREE ACCESS TO TCOYD'S VIRTUAL PROGRAMS AND SHARING SPECIALIZED EDUCATION WHILE PROMOTING POSITIVITY AND ENCOURAGING COMMUNITY CONNECTION ACROSS ALL SOCIAL MEDIA PLATFORMS AND ON THE TCOYD WEBSITE AND DIGITAL MONTHLY NEWSLETTER, TCOYD IMPACTED THE LIVES OF MORE THAN 5 MILLION PEOPLE. IN 2024, TCOYD HELD 2 VIRTUAL CONFERENCES WITH OVER 40 INDIVIDUALIZED EXPERT WORKSHOPS FOR PEOPLE WITH TYPE 1 AND TYPE 2 DIABETES AND THEIR LOVED ONES FOR OVER 10,000 PARTICIPANTS FROM ALL 50 STATES.TCOYD ALSO HELD AN IN-PERSON EVENT FOR ADULTS LIVING WITH TYPE I DIABETES WITH OVER 400 REGISTRANTS. THE PREMIER EVENT FOR TYPE 1S AND THEIR LOVED ONES FROM AROUND THE WORLD, THE ONE CONFERENCE AND RETREAT INCLUDED CUTTING-EDGE PRESENTATIONS AND ENGAGING PANEL DISCUSSIONS ON CURRENT T1D TOPICS.IN ADDITION, TCOYD HELD NINE LIVE ONLINE WORKSHOPS THROUGHOUT THE YEAR WITH DIABETES EXPERTS DISCUSSING CURRENT TOPICS IN HEALTHCARE AS THEY RELATE TO DIABETES MANAGEMENT. EACH WORKSHOP INCLUDED LIVE Q&amp;A - ANSWERING QUESTIONS POSED BY THE DIABETES COMMUNITY. STREAMED LIVE TO AN INTERNATIONAL AUDIENCE.TCOYD FACEBOOK COMMUNITY GROUPS TAILORED TO TYPE 1S, TYPE 2S, AND TYPE 3S (FAMILY MEMBERS, FRIENDS, AND CAREGIVERS) CONNECT OVER 2,000 PEOPLE FROM AROUND THE WORLD TO SHARE IDEAS AND SUPPORT ONE ANOTHER WHILE NAVIGATING THE DAY TODAY OF LIVING WITH, OR HELPING A LOVED ONE LIVE WITH, DIABETES. THE TCOYD VIDEO VAULT, FEATURES A TOPICAL BREAKDOWN OF ALL THE EDUCATIONAL AND ENTERTAINING VIDEOS TCOYD HAS EVER CREATED. THIS RESOURCE CAN BE ACCESSED ON THE TCOYD WEBSITE ANY PLACE, ANY TIME FOR FREE AND HAS OVER 300 VIDEOS.</Desc>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
        <ExpenseAmt>46556</ExpenseAmt>
        <RevenueAmt>87441</RevenueAmt>
        <Desc>CONTINUING MEDICAL EDUCATION PROGRAMS:TCOYD'S CME PROGRAMS ARE CONTENT RICH AND EVIDENCE-BASED, PROVIDING INNOVATIVE EDUCATION THAT IMPACTS PHYSICIANS' KNOWLEDGE, COMPETENCE, AND PERFORMANCE - RESULTING IN IMPROVED PATIENT CARE. THESE ACTIVITIES COVER IMPORTANT CLINICAL TRIALS AND REAL CASE STUDIES TO ACTIVELY ENGAGE PARTICIPANTS TO ENABLE REAL-LIFE IMPLEMENTATION OF IMPROVED PRACTICE HABITS. TOPICS COVERED IN 2024 INCLUDED: HOW TO INTERPRET CONTINUOUS GLUCOSE MONITOR READINGS RAPIDLY TO MAKE A PATIENT VISIT EFFICIENT AND EFFECTIVE. THIS PROGRAM HAD OVER 5,000 PARTICPANTS.</Desc>
